&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Update the data field of a paragraph results with %table to contain null values, e.g.&lt;br/&gt;
    `&quot;data&quot;: &quot;age\tvalue\n19\t4\n20\t3\n21\t7\n22\t9\n23\t20\n24\t24\n25\t44\n26\t77\n27\t94\n28\t103\n29\t97\n20\t5\n20\tnull\n&quot;`&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;p&gt;    The &quot;null&quot; values should be ignored for sum, min, max but included for count (and hence average).&lt;/p&gt;

